# Testing

Read @docs/TESTING.md.

- Unit (Vitest): pricing, VAT split, zones, quote transitions, pesewa format, Paystack amount, webhook idempotency.
- Component (RTL): ProductCard dual CTAs, Ghana address, independent cart/quote counts.
- E2E (Playwright): search→cart, product→RFQ, guest checkout, Paystack init, webhook replay, admin product, admin quote response, accept quote, quote→order, delivery calculation.
- UI work is not done until implemented, tested, and verified in a browser (mobile + desktop + console).
- Never use production Paystack keys in CI. Never assert paid from a redirect URL.
